# Outbound allowlist: copy to allowed-domains.txt (gitignored) and rebuild the image.
# One hostname per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Wildcards are NOT supported; the firewall resolves each entry with dig.

# VS Code CLI update checks and web server asset downloads
update.code.visualstudio.com
# Actual download CDN (update.code.visualstudio.com redirects here for server bundles)
vscode.download.prss.microsoft.com

# VS Code extension marketplace
marketplace.visualstudio.com

# Claude Code API
api.anthropic.com
